  thermodesulfobiia:'Heat-loving anaerobes that reduce sulfate, isolated from hot environments (e.g. Thermodesulfobium).',
  thermosulfidibacteria:'Heat-loving anaerobes from deep-sea hydrothermal vents that use sulfur compounds.',

  // ── Viruses ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
